:: Street Approach Reject
<<if $phase is 1>>
	Unimpressed, you shoot down every single one of <<his>> poor attempts at a pick-up line. Mortified that <<he>> would think such cheesy lines would work on you. And somehow, <<he>> still looks shocked that <<his>> clever oneliners missed their mark.
	<br><br>

	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
		"Come on! Don't be like that!" <<he>> protests. "Let's have some fun! I'll make you feel good."
		<br><br>
		
        <<link [[Relent (0:20)|Street Approach Flirt]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">>
        <<if $arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 and $drunk lt 240>>
            <<link [[Refuse again|Street Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
        <<elseif $willpowerSuccess and $approach_resist>>
            <<link [[Refuse again|Street Approach Reject]]>><<willpowersuccess>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
        <<else>>
            <<set $approach_resist to 0>>
            <span class="lewd"><<He>> has worn you down. You're now going along with <<his>> advances.</span>
        <</if>>
		
		<br>
	<<else>>
		Having run out of ammunition, the <<person>> takes <<his>> leave feeling defeated.
		<br><br>
        <<destinationeventend>>
		/* <<link [[Next|$street_passage]]>><<endevent>><</link>> */
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Despite <<his>> pushiness, you still refuse every attempt <<he>> does to get you to cave. 
	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 750>>
		For a moment it seems the <<person>> is about to lose <<his>> temper, but the disapproving looks of the onlookers appears to scare <<him>> off. With a scornful expression, <<he>> clicks <<his>> tongue one last time before leaving. 
	<<else>>
		Having knocked out the wind out of <<his>> sails, <<he>> makes one last scornful remark before going off.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

    <<destinationeventend>>
	/* <<link [[Next|$street_passage]]>><<endevent>><</link>> */
<</if>>
